  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">제가 화학 전공이 아니다보니 분류법 찾아봐도 잘 모르겠어서요..<br><br>6도어 밀폐 시약장이라 <br>산   I 유기(+지시약)<br>무기  I  염기<br>위험물1  I  위험물2<br><br>로 분류했고, 각 칸 마다 상단/하단 나뉘어져 있어요.<br><br><br>여러 자료보고 대충 끼워맞춰 봤는데..<br><br>혹시 이 중에 같이 보관하면 안되는 것을 보관했거나..더 나은 분류를 조언해주실 수 있을까요?<br><br>도움주셔서 미리 감사합니다!<br></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span></span></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e0d17f2281601b4bc90cd485a6e8a2a6b2fdbeb3\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/e0d17f2281601b4bc90cd485a6e8a2a6b2fdbeb3\" data-origin-width=\"480\" data-origin-height=\"542\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/879420150d2991544f296dc7161e10f371a9503f\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/879420150d2991544f296dc7161e10f371a9503f\" data-origin-width=\"480\" data-origin-height=\"538\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/72d5235f8d79d33455e6f47e44ac1c5838465e40\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/72d5235f8d79d33455e6f47e44ac1c5838465e40\" data-origin-width=\"480\" data-origin-height=\"550\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/42389f0637547096912fc658e34a8fbcace78714\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/42389f0637547096912fc658e34a8fbcace78714\" data-origin-width=\"480\" data-origin-height=\"548\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobile